From 0a76eea4c6679a57103b4bb3a463cab83d580292 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Natalie <spivanatalie64@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 07:23:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] JALK: Add Kconfig symbol, defconfig, scheduler tuning,
 CI/CD, sysfs branding

New features:
  - CONFIG_JALK Kconfig symbol wrapping all JALK features
  - arch/x86/configs/jalk_defconfig for one-command builds
  - kernel/jalk.c provides /sys/kernel/jalk/ sysfs interface
  - include/linux/uts.h: UTS_SYSNAME = JALK when CONFIG_JALK=y
  - init/version-timestamp.c: boot banner shows JALK branding

Optimizations:
  - PREEMPT set as default preemption model (was PREEMPT_NONE)
  - HZ_1000 set as default timer frequency (was HZ_250)
  - sched_base_slice reduced 700us -> 500us for lower latency
  - sched_migration_cost reduced 500us -> 250us for faster balancing
  - BBR set as default TCP congestion control

Infrastructure:
  - .github/workflows/build.yml: GitHub Actions for x86_64/arm64/riscv
  - .gitlab-ci.yml: GitLab CI pipeline for multi-arch builds
  - Dockerfile: Multi-stage container build
  - patches/: 4 optimization patches documenting changes
  - scripts/jalk-kconfig.cfg: Reference optimization snippets
  - Top-level README.md and project Makefile
